|-----------------|-------------------|-------------------|----------------------|-------------------|
| `Sections/HeroSection` | `HeroSection.stories.tsx` | `HeroSectionPreview.tsx` | `components/sections/HeroSection.tsx` | `hero-playground.ts`, `hero-icons-playground.ts`, `layout-playground.ts` |
| `Layout/Header` | `Header.stories.tsx` | `HeaderPreview.tsx` | `components/layout/Header.tsx` | `layout-playground.ts`, `typography-fonts.ts` |
| `Layout/ComplianceBar` | `ComplianceBar.stories.tsx` | `ComplianceBarPreview.tsx` | `components/layout/ComplianceBar.tsx` | `layout-playground.ts`, `typography-fonts.ts` |
| `Sections/TrustBand` | `TrustBand.stories.tsx` | `TrustBandPreview.tsx` | `components/sections/TrustBand.tsx` | `trust-band-playground.ts`, `layout-playground.ts` |
| `Sections/TestimonialsSection` | `TestimonialsSection.stories.tsx` | `TestimonialsSectionPreview.tsx` | `components/sections/TestimonialsSection.tsx` | `testimonials-playground.ts`, `layout-playground.ts` |
